#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0257 expect=skipped domain=SUPPDM
#note "THE QVAL ALL-FACET GATE (Fix #331 bucket 2, M2-D24 / M3-D18; pin owed by review S9 and authored by Fix #340). FRESH FIXTURE - this rule shipped with no scenarios at all. The SUPPDM dataset deliberately declares no QVAL column, so Requirements.Variables.All [QVAL] rejects the dataset and the rule is SKIPPED naming QVAL. Remove the All entry and the rule EXECUTES: since Fix #330 retired the injected var_exists guard, a bare empty(QVAL) is TRUE on every row of an absent column (absent = all-missing) and nothing else in the Check restricts the rows, so it would fire on EVERY row -- the flood the gate exists for. If this scenario EXECUTES (violation or silent pass), the gate has been removed -- escalate, do not rewrite the pin."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset SUPPDM label="Supplemental Qualifiers for DM"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col RDOMAIN  type=Char label="Related Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col IDVAR    type=Char label="Identifying Variable"
col IDVARVAL type=Char label="Identifying Variable Value"
col QNAM     type=Char label="Qualifier Variable Name"
col QLABEL   type=Char label="Qualifier Variable Label"
col QORIG    type=Char label="Origin"
---
S1 | DM | S1-001 |  |  | STRAIN | Strain | CRF
S1 | DM | S1-002 |  |  | STRAIN | Strain | CRF
---
